hilbert-derivable]] 的标准一阶 Hilbert 可推导关系；数码与同时代入取 [[57-df-numeral]]、[[57-df-representable]]。$\\varphi_P$ 仅在选定一个表示公式后使用，不假设每个 $P$ 都已有这样的公式。"},{"id":"4744f89052b0cbdb","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 扩展 [[57-df-S-ar]] 的算术语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$，$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k$。固定互异变量 $\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)$ 和证明系统 $\\mathcal P$；$\\vdash$ 指 $\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}$。$\\varphi[\\underline{\\vec n}/\\vec x]$ 为同时把各 $x_i$ 的自由出现替换为闭数码 $\\underline{n_i}$，数码见 [[57-df-numeral]]。"},{"id":"84855d15623b48d9","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$，$Q\\subseteq T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S}$，见 [[57-df-robinson-arithmetic]]。$\\vdash$ 指 [[57-df-hilbert-derivable]] 的标准一阶 Hilbert 推导；$g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)$。$\\bot=\\neg\\forall x_0(x_0\\doteq x_0)$。$\\mathrm{Con}(T)$ 取 [[57-df-consistency]]，并使用标准 Hilbert 与经典矢列演算的等价读法。$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}$，$\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}$，$\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}$。代入仅把自由的 $x$ 替换为闭数码，见 [[57-df-numeral]]。"},{"id":"169eff8c77e31e76","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8d03cb367dadda8f","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9880eab1adc3d630","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$，$\\mathfrak A=\\mathfrak N$ 是 [[57-df-S-ar]] 的标准算术结构；$g$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)$。$x$ 为固定变量，$\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak A}=\\operatorname{TrueCode}_{\\mathfrak A,g}$ 取 [[57-df-truth-predicate]]；代入数码取 [[57-df-numeral]]。"},{"id":"b669992ec0ec3e08","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S=\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\cup\\{c\\}$，$c$ 为新常量，其他分区不变。$\\Phi_{\\mathrm{PA2}}$ 取 [[57-thm-so-nat]] 并按同一语法嵌入扩张语言；$\\overline n$ 为 [[57-df-numeral]] 的数码。$\\mathrm{SO}$ 是 [[57-df-compactness-property]] 的语义表示，其句子集为 $\\mathrm{FullSent}_S^2$、真值由完全二阶语义给定。$\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathrm{SO},S}$ 取该表示的可满足性。"},{"id":"73eb4bf154d08499","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$，$\\mathfrak A=\\mathfrak N$ 是 [[57-df-S-ar]] 的标准算术结构；$g$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)$。$x$ 为固定变量，$\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak A}=\\operatorname{TrueCode}_{\\mathfrak A,g}$ 取 [[57-df-truth-predicate]]；代入数码取 [[57-df-numeral]]。$S(\\mathbb N)$ 在 $S$ 上为每个 $n\\in\\mathbb N$ 加入互异新常量 $c_n$；$\\mathfrak N^+$ 将 $c_n$ 解释为 $n$。$\\mathrm{ElDiag}(\\mathbb N)$ 由下式在本文件定义；扩张语言保留原符号分区，仅添加零元函数符号 $c_n$。"},{"id":"04536d8a98748b81","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$，$\\mathfrak A=\\mathfrak N$ 是 [[57-df-S-ar]] 的标准算术结构；$g$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)$。$x$ 为固定变量，$\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak A}=\\operatorname{TrueCode}_{\\mathfrak A,g}$ 取 [[57-df-truth-predicate]]；代入数码取 [[57-df-numeral]]。$R\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{Definable}(R,\\mathfrak A)$ 是下式的元层可定义性谓词。"},{"id":"4a894c201e15cf14","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$，$\\mathfrak A=\\mathfrak N$ 是 [[57-df-S-ar]] 的标准算术结构；$g$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)$。$x$ 为固定变量，$\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak A}=\\operatorname{TrueCode}_{\\mathfrak A,g}$ 取 [[57-df-truth-predicate]]；代入数码取 [[57-df-numeral]]。$\\mathrm{RE}$ 取 [[57-df-recursively-enumerable]] 的自然数集合类，$\\mathrm{Rec}$ 取 [[57-df-arith0]]。"},{"id":"536f78c4d1ada7bd","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$，$\\mathfrak A=\\mathfrak N$ 是 [[57-df-S-ar]] 的标准算术结构；$g$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)$。$x$ 为固定变量，$\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak A}=\\operatorname{TrueCode}_{\\mathfrak A,g}$ 取 [[57-df-truth-predicate]]；代入数码取 [[57-df-numeral]]。本文件 $\\mathrm{Dec}$ 使用 [[57-df-decidable-theory]] 的理论类，演算固定为标准 Hilbert 演算。$\\ma